  "releaseNotes": "- 1.0.1 version includes a bug fix for the RabbitMQFeed related to the initial connection with RabbitMQ.\n            - 2.0.0 Added handling for TransportMessageHeaders as part of the RabbitMQFeed message handling.\n            - 2.1.0 Added message processor registration for OutrightLeagueSettlementUpdate to support new outright league settlement messages\n\t\t\t- 2.1.1 Fixed an issue with the RabbitMQFeed where it did not properly handle message acknowledgments, leading to potential message loss in high-throughput scenarios.\n\t\t\t- 2.2.0 Enhanced JSON deserialization with case-insensitive property matching and camel case naming policy support. Improved exception logging in MessageProcessor.",
